 program id, or read-only/sysvar ref — not a privileged caller whose signature matters","account.is_signer is asserted (or the field is a Signer<>/Account<>) before any state mutation","the account is never used to authorize a state change or fund movement — on-chain OR by an off-chain consumer of its emitted/logged key"]},"severity":"WARNING","fingerprint":"requires login","lines":"requires login","validation_state":"NO_VALIDATOR","engine_kind":"OSS"}},{"check_id":"rules.solana-security-standard.sol-006-raw-account-info","path":"/src/src/processor.rs","start":{"line":940,"col":35,"offset":39869},"end":{"line":940,"col":47,"offset":39881},"extra":{"message":"Jelleo SOL-006: raw `AccountInfo` (no Signer<>/Account<> type). If this account is a privileged CALLER, verify `account.is_signer == true` before mutating state, or use Anchor's `Signer<>`. (A documented `/// CHECK:` account used only as a CPI target / program ID / read-only ref is fine — this is a heuristic flag.) See: github.com/Copenhagen0x/solana-security-standard#sol-006.","metadata":{"sol-id":"SOL-006","category":"security","confidence":"LOW","technology":["solana","anchor"],"references":["https://github.com/Copenhagen0x/solana-security-standard#sol-006"],"license":"MIT","sss-tier":"high","sss-severity":"high","sss-exclusions":["the AccountInfo is a documented `/// CHECK:` used only as a CPI target, program id, or read-only/sysvar ref — not a privileged caller whose signature matters","account.is_signer is asserted (or the field is a Signer<>/Account<>) before any state mutation","the account is never used to authorize a state change or fund movement — on-chain OR by an off-chain consumer of its emitted/logged key"]},"severity":"WARNING","fingerprint":"requires login","lines":"requires login","validation_state":"NO_VALIDATOR","engine_kind":"OSS"}},{"check_id":"rules.solana-security-standard.sol-006-raw-account-info","path":"/src/src/processor.rs","start":{"line":941,"col":28,"offset":39913},"end":{"line":9